  | ok mode 'r+D'
  | ok mode 'wD'
  | ok mode 'wbD'
  | ok mode 'w+D'
  | ok mode 'w+tD'
  | ok mode 'aD'
  | ok mode 'a+D'
  | ok mode 'wxD'
  | ok mode 'r,'
  | ok mode 'r,ccs'
