  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample -1
  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample 0
  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample 1
  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample 2
  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample 3
  | ok ccs 'w+,ccs=UTF-16LE' sample 4
  | ok mode 'a+,ccs=UTF-8'
  | ok ccs 'a+,ccs=UTF-8' sample -1
  | ok ccs 'a+,ccs=UTF-8' sample 0
